			"notes": "- Moved to quilt toolchain, rewritten in kotlin, and refactored several major systems\n- Deepslate ores now give *slightly* more XP on average\n- Ability to set custom XP for blocks and entities\n- Ability to hide stats from players\n- XP bar system\n- Near everything translatable\n- Custom entity selectors\n- Support for Switchy\n- Revamped cheat command supporting removing XP and levels properly\n- All attribute bugs are fixed (notably gaining/losing health)\n- Revamped configs\n- Commands have proper return values\n- GUI temporarily removed"
		},
